comment = "Nested virtualization test harness (metapackage)"

desc = <<EOD
This metapackage installs the nested virtualization test harness and its
measurement store.

It installs alongside an existing userland rather than replacing it, so it can
be added to a machine running the nested virtualization kernel as an overlay.
EOD
